ess  so i hope you enjoyed today's episode  just before you leave today a quick plug  for one of my other shows the casual  criminalist it's a true crime show where  we dive into the stories of some of the  worst of the worst murderers serial  killers cult leaders we cover it all but  it's also pretty laid back doesn't take  itself too seriously and it could even  be called a bit fun it's the casual  criminalist there's a link below also  available as a podcast by the way  and thank you for watching  you

